Package: guitarfx
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: https://github.com/krl91/tuxguitaradvanced
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libgl1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/krl91/tuxguitaradvanced
Description: Amp and effect pedals for the guitar
 GuitarFX turns the computer into a guitar amp with effect pedals: noise gate,
 compressor, overdrive, distortion, amp with cabinet, chorus, echo and reverb.
 It is also a VST3 and CLAP plugin for music software. It needs no Java.
